# DE Desk design

Primary file: `client/src/components/ZohoASAPWidget.tsx`. Full playbook: `.cursor/skills/de-desk-ui/SKILL.md`.

## Shell (all tabs)

- **One graphite shell** (`--de-surface` / hairline). No purple glow. No cream-in-purple nested card.
- Magenta `#D3126A` for avatar emphasis, active underline, send, CTAs, incident rail. Violet is lighting only.
- Active tab: light label + magenta underline.
- Composer, status strip, and repeated footer stay off Client Tools.

## Tab content

| Tab | Job |
|-----|-----|
| **Ask DE** | Conversational UI on graphite. Composer dominant. Two quiet chips. |
| **Get Support** | Issue choices + dark raised form + magenta submit. |
| **Client Tools** | White grouped launcher: Portal (featured), Remote Support + Fastest + guide, Help Center, Service Status, then security escape → `selectTab("ticket")` + `applyTicketChip("security-incident")`. |

Do not put Cyber Risk Assessment, billing, or a 2×2 grid on Client Tools.

## Copy

- Label **functions**, not vendor products.
- Keep links/endpoints; change visible titles only.
- Portal login via `PORTAL_LOGIN` — never invent `//login`.

## Logic

Preserve chat send/poll, agent live, ticket submit (fail-closed), resources links, analytics, ASAP bootstrap, cookie offset, `de-open-msp-advisor`, drag/resize/expand, unread/heads-up.

Composer is **Ask DE only**. Incoming replies on other tabs: heads-up + Ask DE badge.

Do not say “online” unless a human has joined. Do not add billing as a Desk choice.
